.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# data/raw and data/processed are DVC's from M1-S2 on: `dvc add` wrote them into
# data/.gitignore, which is the tracked, authoritative entry. Repeating them here
# would be twins — and a stale copy here would keep hiding the data even if the
# DVC tracking were removed by accident, which is exactly the failure you want loud.
# The DuckDB catalogue is regenerable: `make duckdb`.
data/analyst.duckdb
data/analyst.duckdb.wal
mlruns/
.dvc/cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
*.egg-info/
notebooks/*.ipynb_checkpoints/
.idea/
automation/logs/
automation/STOP
